@startuml
title State Diagram: Reservation Lifecycle (Corrected)

top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 14
}
skinparam ArrowColor Black

[*] --> Draft

Draft --> PendingPayment : Reservation details submitted

PendingPayment --> Confirmed : Payment successful
PendingPayment --> Cancelled : Payment failed / timeout

Confirmed --> ModifyRequested : Driver requests modification
ModifyRequested --> Confirmed : Modification accepted (reservation updated)
ModifyRequested --> Confirmed : Modification rejected (keep original)

Confirmed --> Active : Vehicle enters within time window
Active --> Completed : Vehicle exits

Confirmed --> Cancelled : Driver cancels reservation (policy applies)

Active --> ViolationHold : Violation detected (overstay/unpaid/etc.)
ViolationHold --> Active : Violation resolved
ViolationHold --> Completed : Exit allowed after resolution

Cancelled --> [*]
Completed --> [*]

@enduml
